<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <title>Noah Humbert</title>
        {% include 'partials/_head.html.twig' %}
    </head>

    <body>
        <!-- Top Navitation Bar-->
        {% include 'partials/_navbar.html.twig' %}

        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="container mt-2 mb-2 text-center">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <p class="fs-1 my-0">Mentorship Program</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Top Screen Schedule button -->
        <div class="row mt-1 justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-lg-2 col-6 d-grid gap-2">
                <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://calendar.app.google/nyvMuGC8DBSDuFK3A">Book a Free Call</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Who it's for  -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-10">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-md-8">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4">Who It's For?</h5>
                                    <p class="fs-6">
                                        This mentorship program is geared towards young adults who want to find direction in life and want to achieve discipline,
                                        direction, and financial growth. This program is NOT a get rich quick guide. This guide will teach you how to carve your own
                                        path in life
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- noahhumbert.com -->
        <div class="container my-5">
            <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
                <div class="col-12 col-lg-10">
                    <div class="card" style="max-width: auto;">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-md-8">
                                <div class="card-body">
                                    <h5 class="fs-2 mb-4">Why listen to me?</h5>
                                    <p class="fs-6">
                                        At 18, as a 4.2 GPA student at the top of my class, I decided that I wanted to carve my own path and ditched the stereotypical
                                        college route. I went full time at a local company on the IT helpdesk. Over the last year, I have implemented and improved
                                        hundreds of business critical processes. While achieving all of this, I was also able to purchase a home at 19 years old. A 
                                        home for me is not just about a place to live, but about owning a tangible asset that will not lose value as the dollar inflates
                                        at a rapid rate. If I can do it, so can you. Let me teach you how.
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>